    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This landscape puzzle game uses childlike, nostalgic elements as pieces. Choose to challenge high - score strategic play or enter free - creation mode to build your own wonderland. Plus, there are many hidden surprises and secrets to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Return to that summer and feel the sunshine and the chirping of cicadas.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique wood - carving aesthetic style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich variety of themes and puzzle pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple small and surprising gameplay elements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425510/extras/6589045e722414de14e6072119420c87.avif?t=1751386988\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The process of wood carving production</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425510/extras/6199924337cc8ca99e4cd2f921a86e77.avif?t=1751386988\" width=800 height=800 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425510/extras/8524c45f05e0932d3ea16633da6e4eaa.avif?t=1751386988\" width=800 height=800 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425510/extras/445a38f9a30ab26a60594ac8adb577dc.avif?t=1751386988\" width=800 height=1067 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425510/extras/cd563a138607d37483f133157250677f.avif?t=1751386988\" width=800 height=600 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"h